* A `prefixLeafs_` array that stores the prefix leaf nodes of the octree.
* A `dataArray_` vector that stores the data records in the octree.

The implementation also includes a number of error handling mechanisms to manage cases where memory allocation fails or concurrent access leads to inconsistencies, ensuring robustness under adverse conditions.']

