The `updateFlowActivityLevels` function periodically checks and updates the activity level of each flow based on real-time network conditions. The `pruneInactiveFlows` function periodically prunes the list of flows that have been inactive for a specified duration, ensuring that the system can handle spikes in traffic efficiently without consuming excessive resources.

