The function logs any failures during the population process using a logging mechanism that does not degrade performance under high load. It also validates the API credentials and ensures network connectivity before sending HTTP POST requests to update the environmental control parameters in the remote server. The function returns a tuple containing the average temperature and humidity, a string indicating the updated settings, and a boolean indicating whether the data processing and parameter updates were successful.

