The code uses a linked list data structure to store network device instances and a hash table to map MAC addresses to network device instances. The hash table is used to efficiently look up network device instances by MAC address, which is useful for retrieving devices by index or MAC address. The code also includes a mechanism to periodically clean up unused devices to reclaim memory and reduce fragmentation.

